IMPORT prelude

-- sga-defs.l4: the defined terms of the Superannuation Guarantee (Administration) Act 1992 (Commonwealth), sections 1 to 80
-- (Federal Register compilation C2026C00272, plain-text conversion; not the authorised text). GENERATED by a script that reads the text file.
-- One entry per defined term in the text: the term, how the text defines it ("means", "includes", "has the meaning given by", "has the same meaning as in",
-- "has a meaning affected by", "is"), what it points at (the provision or the instrument named), and the definition as printed.
-- A term defined by pointing at another instrument is not given a meaning here; where a rule needs it, the rule asks the fact as an input.

DECLARE `Defined term` HAS
    term IS A STRING
    how IS A STRING
    pointer IS A STRING
    text IS A STRING

-- src:49 | Commonwealth Department means:
-- src:50 | (a) a Department of State; or
-- src:51 | (b) a Department of the Parliament established under the Parliamentary Service Act 1999; or
-- src:52 | (c) a branch or part of the Australian Public Service in relation to which a person has, under an Act, the powers of, or exercisable by, the Secretary of a Department of the Australian Public Service.
@ref s 5(5) "Commonwealth Department" (src:49-52)
`defined term: Commonwealth Department` MEANS `Defined term` OF "Commonwealth Department", "means", "", "Commonwealth Department means: (a) a Department of State; or (b) a Department of the Parliament established under the Parliamentary Service Act 1999; or (c) a branch or part of the Australian Public Service in relation to which a person has, under an Act, the powers of, or exercisable by, the Secretary of a Department of the Australian Public Service."

