GIVEN t IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE `Defined term`
`the defined term called` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN d YIELD d's term EQUALS t) `the defined terms of the text`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN d FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST d

GIVEN t IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the way a term is defined` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the defined term called` t
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST d THEN JUST (d's how)

GIVEN t IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`what a term points at` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the defined term called` t
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST d THEN JUST (d's pointer)

